1
00:00:00,012 --> 00:00:02,014
[upbeat music]

2
00:00:09,813 --> 00:00:10,731
[Anzu grunts]

3
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:20,574
[Anzu] "To Ms. Anzu Hoshino."

4
00:00:20,657 --> 00:00:21,658
PRODUCT TYPE: VIDEO GAME

5
00:00:21,742 --> 00:00:24,077
Hooray! It's finally here!

6
00:00:24,161 --> 00:00:25,120
[moans happily]

7
00:00:25,203 --> 00:00:28,832
[Anzu] My entire purpose in life
is right here in my hands!

8
00:00:29,833 --> 00:00:30,917
Look at this!

9
00:00:31,001 --> 00:00:32,669
[Anzu] Ever since elementary school,

10
00:00:32,753 --> 00:00:34,921
I spent my time
playing games with the boys.

11
00:00:35,005 --> 00:00:36,256
[boys groaning]

12
00:00:36,339 --> 00:00:37,257
[Anzu] In junior high…

13
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:39,426
-Hey, karaoke tonight?
-[giggles]

14
00:00:39,509 --> 00:00:41,344
[Anzu] Beating the final boss
was more important

15
00:00:41,428 --> 00:00:44,264
than hanging out with boys.
[screams]

16
00:00:44,347 --> 00:00:45,599
[laughs]

17
00:00:45,682 --> 00:00:47,851
-Whoa, are you really eating all that?
-Huh?

18
00:00:47,934 --> 00:00:50,103
Won't you gain weight?
And you'll break out.

19
00:00:50,187 --> 00:00:51,021
[laughs]

20
00:00:51,104 --> 00:00:54,399
[Anzu] I don't care what anyone says,
chocolate is my life!

21
00:00:54,483 --> 00:00:56,318
NOPE, DON'T EAT THEM
DON'T WORRY ABOUT IT, GOBBLE IT DOWN

22
00:00:57,152 --> 00:00:58,737
I love you!

23
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:02,407
-[meowing]
-But the love of my life is Momohiki!

24
00:01:02,491 --> 00:01:03,825
CUDDLE MOMOHIKI
KISS MOMOHIKI

25
00:01:03,909 --> 00:01:07,829
Romance was non-existent in my life until…

26
00:01:08,747 --> 00:01:10,332
[dreamy music]

27
00:01:12,417 --> 00:01:14,711
Why… Why am I…
[gulps]

28
00:01:16,797 --> 00:01:18,298
…yuka-don-ing this hottie?

29
00:01:20,425 --> 00:01:24,179
[evil chuckle]

30
00:01:28,975 --> 00:01:30,977
[theme music]

31
00:02:57,981 --> 00:02:59,900
[meowing]

32
00:02:59,983 --> 00:03:00,859
[moans]

33
00:03:00,942 --> 00:03:03,028
I get to play my video game

34
00:03:03,111 --> 00:03:04,279
all weekend long.

35
00:03:04,362 --> 00:03:08,867
Yeah! All-nighter, let's do this!

36
00:03:10,952 --> 00:03:12,787
[Anzu hums happily]

37
00:03:13,955 --> 00:03:15,123
Aah…

38
00:03:15,206 --> 00:03:18,376
Huh? Did they change the opening a bit?

39
00:03:19,294 --> 00:03:23,590
Ah, whatever! Start button!

40
00:03:23,673 --> 00:03:26,468
[girl pants, screams]

41
00:03:27,177 --> 00:03:29,596
Are you okay? Did you get hurt?

42
00:03:32,182 --> 00:03:34,100
[both laugh]

43
00:03:35,101 --> 00:03:36,311
[boy] Oh!

44
00:03:36,394 --> 00:03:37,437
[gasps]

45
00:03:38,313 --> 00:03:40,732
[both laugh]

46
00:03:41,399 --> 00:03:43,735
What the heck is with this terrible game?

47
00:03:44,527 --> 00:03:47,739
Oh, come on,
this has to be the wrong game!

48
00:03:48,782 --> 00:03:49,991
Hm?

49
00:03:50,075 --> 00:03:51,117
[grunting]

50
00:03:51,910 --> 00:03:55,413
[grunting, yelping]

51
00:03:55,497 --> 00:03:56,873
A fanfare, please!

52
00:03:57,540 --> 00:04:00,377
You've been selected today as subject one.

53
00:04:00,460 --> 00:04:02,337
-So, congratulations!
-[gasps]

54
00:04:03,338 --> 00:04:07,300
Hello! I'm Riri, the wizard,
who grants all of your dreams.

55
00:04:07,384 --> 00:04:08,885
What? A wizard?

56
00:04:09,427 --> 00:04:11,471
-It's complicated to explain…
-Hm.

57
00:04:11,554 --> 00:04:15,016
…so for the time being,
please, just read this carefully.

58
00:04:16,101 --> 00:04:18,561
What's up with all this legalese
in a magic-themed game?

59
00:04:18,645 --> 00:04:20,480
-And it goes on forever!
-Ugh…

60
00:04:20,563 --> 00:04:23,066
[Anzu] Can you just explain it
in a few sentences?

61
00:04:23,149 --> 00:04:24,484
You mean like this?

62
00:04:24,567 --> 00:04:27,237
[Anzu] No! Just give me a brief summary.

63
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:29,281
Well, to put it simply,

64
00:04:29,364 --> 00:04:31,408
-we came all the way from the Magic World…
-[groans]

65
00:04:31,491 --> 00:04:35,787
…to support those with no experience
with romantic relationships like you.

66
00:04:35,870 --> 00:04:36,871
[Anzu groans]
Count me out.

67
00:04:36,955 --> 00:04:40,417
So, when did your heart
last throb for a guy?

68
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:45,422
[Anzu] Oh… Like with Lord Matthew
and Swordsman Musashimaru?

69
00:04:45,505 --> 00:04:47,924
-Those are games characters, right?
-[grunts]

70
00:04:48,008 --> 00:04:52,304
You're in high school, it's time
to quit dreaming and face reality.

71
00:04:52,387 --> 00:04:54,931
Aren't you the wizard
who's supposed to grant my dreams?

72
00:04:55,015 --> 00:04:56,433
-[Riri] But…
-[gasps]

73
00:04:56,516 --> 00:04:58,893
I'm here now, there's no need to worry.

74
00:04:59,477 --> 00:05:03,648
[Riri] I'm here to grant girls like you,
who rejects all opportunities of romance,

75
00:05:03,732 --> 00:05:06,901
a chance to experience love
through this dating game

76
00:05:06,985 --> 00:05:08,278
Dating game!

77
00:05:08,361 --> 00:05:09,404
-Sorry.
-[Riri] Dating game!

78
00:05:09,487 --> 00:05:12,407
I'm not understanding
a word that you're saying.

79
00:05:12,490 --> 00:05:16,077
It seems to me you have no problem
with those dating games

80
00:05:16,161 --> 00:05:19,539
as long as they're made for women.
Isn't that right, huh?

81
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:21,416
Hmm, sure…

82
00:05:22,125 --> 00:05:28,423
Well then, as the selected test subject,
you'll get to enjoy living your life

83
00:05:28,506 --> 00:05:32,469
just like the heroine
of the game I programmed,

84
00:05:32,552 --> 00:05:34,929
Romantic Thriller!

85
00:05:35,013 --> 00:05:37,766
Did you watch the lovely opening sequence?

86
00:05:37,849 --> 00:05:39,601
And for you, Anzu,

87
00:05:40,101 --> 00:05:42,520
your romance experience scores at zero

88
00:05:42,604 --> 00:05:44,647
-so it may have been too intense.
-[growls]

89
00:05:44,731 --> 00:05:46,149
-[Anzu] No, I just knew I was playing…
-[giggles]

90
00:05:46,232 --> 00:05:49,778
…a terrible game with total amateur
writing and production value.

91
00:05:49,861 --> 00:05:52,655
Ah, so you're particular
about the virtual world

92
00:05:52,739 --> 00:05:54,616
despite having no romantic experiences

93
00:05:54,699 --> 00:05:56,201
-in reality.
-Of course! Do you have any idea

94
00:05:56,284 --> 00:05:58,244
-how many dating games I've finished?
-[groans]

95
00:05:58,328 --> 00:06:00,830
[Riri] But imagine
if you could experience life

96
00:06:00,914 --> 00:06:03,666
surrounded by hot guys for real
just like in the dating game,

97
00:06:03,750 --> 00:06:06,795
even your heart would flutter
with excitement, don't you think?

98
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:09,255
In-- In real life?

99
00:06:09,339 --> 00:06:10,298
[Riri] That's right.

100
00:06:10,381 --> 00:06:11,633
[in deep voice]
In real life.

101
00:06:12,217 --> 00:06:14,135
A super normie life

102
00:06:14,219 --> 00:06:16,638
filled with ago-kui…
[kissing]

103
00:06:16,721 --> 00:06:20,809
Lots of kissing and kabe-don awaits you!
[moans happily]

104
00:06:20,892 --> 00:06:23,520
-Re-- Really?
-Yes, really!

105
00:06:24,062 --> 00:06:29,317
[Riri] All kinds of serious hotties agree
to start appearing around you.

106
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:32,529
[squeals]
And you're gonna be oh so busy!

107
00:06:32,612 --> 00:06:33,905
That many guys?

108
00:06:33,988 --> 00:06:38,076
You see, Anzu? Aren't you beginning
to see me as an angel?

109
00:06:38,159 --> 00:06:41,579
But, no, I already have
the love of my life, Momohiki!

110
00:06:41,663 --> 00:06:43,373
Wait! Where is he?

111
00:06:43,456 --> 00:06:46,334
[gasps]
Momohiki! Huh! Oh! Momohiki?

112
00:06:46,417 --> 00:06:50,713
Ahem. To keep you focus
on your romantic relationships,

113
00:06:50,797 --> 00:06:54,551
your favorite video games, chocolate,
your cat, your three greatest desires

114
00:06:54,634 --> 00:06:56,970
have all been confiscated by yours truly.

115
00:06:57,053 --> 00:06:58,847
Confiscated?

116
00:06:58,930 --> 00:07:01,766
[chuckles nervously]
Are you kidding? Come on! There's no way.

117
00:07:01,850 --> 00:07:04,269
-[evil laughter]
-[gasps]

118
00:07:04,352 --> 00:07:07,188
No!
[whines]

119
00:07:08,148 --> 00:07:10,066
Huh?
[wails]

120
00:07:10,150 --> 00:07:11,234
See?

121
00:07:12,569 --> 00:07:14,529
-[laughs]
-[groans]

122
00:07:18,658 --> 00:07:21,119
[Anzu] All… All of my games

123
00:07:21,202 --> 00:07:25,457
have turned into
Kabayaki-chan Goro snacks!

124
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:28,793
[Riri] And look,
it's the "soft" kind, too.

125
00:07:29,335 --> 00:07:30,211
Not funny at all!

126
00:07:30,795 --> 00:07:32,338
What about my chocolate?

127
00:07:33,798 --> 00:07:34,716
[gasps]

128
00:07:34,799 --> 00:07:36,968
[Anzu] What? Oh, no!

129
00:07:37,051 --> 00:07:38,970
There's no chocolate on anything!

130
00:07:39,053 --> 00:07:41,848
The delicious parts are all totally gone!

131
00:07:41,931 --> 00:07:42,891
[evil laughter]

132
00:07:42,974 --> 00:07:44,476
Confiscated.

133
00:07:44,559 --> 00:07:48,563
Eating too much chocolate is bad
for your skin and it's a lot of fat.

134
00:07:48,646 --> 00:07:51,232
[Anzu] Don't say that
while you're covered in chocolate!

135
00:07:51,316 --> 00:07:53,276
-So now do you understand what it means…
-[Anzu crying]

136
00:07:53,359 --> 00:07:55,528
…to eliminate your three greatest desires?

137
00:07:55,612 --> 00:07:56,446
Monster!

138
00:07:56,529 --> 00:08:00,658
[Riri] If you want to gain something,
you have to pay the price.

139
00:08:00,742 --> 00:08:02,202
-Did you think you'll get a paradise…
-[growls]

140
00:08:02,285 --> 00:08:05,497
…of hotties for free?
Don't be ridiculous! Come on!

141
00:08:05,580 --> 00:08:06,748
You devil!

142
00:08:06,831 --> 00:08:09,209
Hey! Please, watch your mouth.

143
00:08:09,292 --> 00:08:13,046
To be honest with you, I'm just
your everyday gentle-hearted wizard.

144
00:08:13,630 --> 00:08:16,382
I'm saying this
with your best interest at heart.

145
00:08:16,466 --> 00:08:19,469
What is this? Brainwashing?
Some sketchy cult?

146
00:08:19,552 --> 00:08:24,307
This is the only way that'll get you
to prioritize cuties over your cat.

147
00:08:24,390 --> 00:08:26,893
-Ugh…
-[Momohiki shrieks]

148
00:08:26,976 --> 00:08:28,353
[Riri] When you get lonely,

149
00:08:28,436 --> 00:08:31,689
you most likely turn to chocolates
instead of a boyfriend.

150
00:08:31,773 --> 00:08:32,649
[chuckles awkwardly]

151
00:08:32,732 --> 00:08:35,068
Instead of setting aside time for dates,

152
00:08:35,151 --> 00:08:37,070
you spend all your time playing games.

153
00:08:37,153 --> 00:08:38,655
[Anzu grunting]

154
00:08:38,738 --> 00:08:40,406
So now, do you get it?
[giggles]

155
00:08:40,490 --> 00:08:44,410
How toxic your three greatest desires are
for romantic relationships?

156
00:08:44,494 --> 00:08:48,498
They will be confiscated indefinitely
until you achieve

157
00:08:48,581 --> 00:08:52,085
a lovely Romantic Thriller-level
relationship!

158
00:08:52,168 --> 00:08:53,002
FOREVER CONFISCATED

159
00:08:53,086 --> 00:08:54,879
Impossible! Riri!

160
00:08:55,922 --> 00:08:58,925
[Anzu] I can't even handle
a day without them!

161
00:08:59,008 --> 00:09:01,177
I can live without guys, okay?

162
00:09:01,261 --> 00:09:05,515
But my three greatest desires
are a total necessity for me!

163
00:09:06,140 --> 00:09:08,351
-That's exactly why you were chosen.
-[whines]

164
00:09:08,434 --> 00:09:09,602
Like I said,

165
00:09:09,686 --> 00:09:14,399
we are here to solve Japan's extremely
serious low birth rate problem.

166
00:09:14,482 --> 00:09:16,734
Low birth rate?
That's what this is all about?

167
00:09:16,818 --> 00:09:18,987
Look at that.
You didn't read the explanation

168
00:09:19,070 --> 00:09:21,489
-in the beginning carefully.
-[groans]

169
00:09:22,323 --> 00:09:23,199
Either way,

170
00:09:23,283 --> 00:09:25,994
I'll be assisting you
with your romantic relationships

171
00:09:26,077 --> 00:09:27,453
as best as I can.

172
00:09:27,537 --> 00:09:32,417
For love, for the future of Japan,
and most importantly, for my salary!

173
00:09:32,500 --> 00:09:34,836
Keep that last part
to yourself, all right?

174
00:09:34,919 --> 00:09:36,671
-Oh, my goodness!
-Huh?

175
00:09:36,754 --> 00:09:39,757
I forgot that I left the stove on earlier.

176
00:09:39,841 --> 00:09:42,635
-Well, time to go back to the Magic World.
-[grunts]

177
00:09:42,719 --> 00:09:45,013
-I am not getting involved with this!
-[wails]

178
00:09:45,096 --> 00:09:47,140
[Riri] Actually, remember hitting
your start button before?

179
00:09:47,223 --> 00:09:49,475
Too late! There's no turning back

180
00:09:49,559 --> 00:09:51,978
even if it feels like
sailing a boat made of mud.

181
00:09:52,061 --> 00:09:53,396
No way! A mud boat!

182
00:09:53,479 --> 00:09:55,898
Come on, it was only a little joke.

183
00:09:55,982 --> 00:09:59,777
In reality, an exciting,
Titanic-level romance awaits you!

184
00:09:59,861 --> 00:10:02,905
[grunts]
Either way, the boat is sinking.

185
00:10:02,989 --> 00:10:06,784
Life without my three greatest desires
is gonna be miserable.

186
00:10:06,868 --> 00:10:09,162
Give me back my reason to live!

187
00:10:09,245 --> 00:10:11,789
-[Riri] Until next time! Bon voyage!
-[gasps]

188
00:10:11,873 --> 00:10:13,833
Wait a sec! Hey! Wait!

189
00:10:13,916 --> 00:10:15,335
[gasps]

190
00:10:16,336 --> 00:10:18,087
-Mom! Where's Momohiki?
-Huh?

191
00:10:18,171 --> 00:10:20,715
-Hm, he's right over there.
-[yelps]

192
00:10:20,798 --> 00:10:23,217
[Anzu] Why the heck is he up there?

193
00:10:23,301 --> 00:10:26,346
Momohiki, please, please, please,
show me your cute face!

194
00:10:26,429 --> 00:10:28,097
[kisses, wails]

195
00:10:28,181 --> 00:10:29,265
-[Anzu's dad] I'm home!
-[wails]

196
00:10:29,349 --> 00:10:30,183
Huh?

197
00:10:31,225 --> 00:10:33,478
-[Miyoko] Oh, you're home early.
-[Anzu wails]

198
00:10:33,561 --> 00:10:35,647
Yeah. I know this is sudden…

199
00:10:35,730 --> 00:10:36,731
Momohiki, please…

200
00:10:36,814 --> 00:10:39,442
…but it's been decided
that I'll be transferred to the US.

201
00:10:39,525 --> 00:10:40,902
-Wow!
-What?

202
00:10:41,903 --> 00:10:43,821
And I want you to come with me.

203
00:10:43,905 --> 00:10:47,325
It's always been
a dream of mine to live overseas.

204
00:10:48,242 --> 00:10:50,286
Wait! What about me?

205
00:10:50,370 --> 00:10:52,288
Anzu, honey, you have school.

206
00:10:52,372 --> 00:10:53,665
[Anzu's dad] It will only be two
or three years.

207
00:10:53,748 --> 00:10:54,582
-What?
-[Anzu's dad] You should be able

208
00:10:54,666 --> 00:10:56,834
-to hold down the fort yourself by now.
-Mm-hmm.

209
00:10:56,918 --> 00:10:59,754
-We'll take Momohiki with us too.
-Wait! Things are happening too fast!

210
00:11:00,421 --> 00:11:04,509
[Anzu] And Dad, aren't you
a post office employee?

211
00:11:04,592 --> 00:11:06,886
Why is the relocation, seriously?

212
00:11:07,804 --> 00:11:09,639
-We should get started packing right away.
-[Miyoko chuckling softly]

213
00:11:09,722 --> 00:11:11,724
And we should also celebrate tonight.

214
00:11:12,475 --> 00:11:13,768
[birds chirping]

215
00:11:16,062 --> 00:11:17,480
All right then, we're off.

216
00:11:17,563 --> 00:11:20,900
Make sure you eat every day.
And keep all the doors locked.

217
00:11:20,983 --> 00:11:23,027
-[groans]
-[both] Take care!

218
00:11:23,111 --> 00:11:24,570
[retreating footsteps]

219
00:11:26,364 --> 00:11:29,367
[Anzu] It took them no time to pack
and they're moving overseas.

220
00:11:29,450 --> 00:11:32,328
Mom and Dad
were much too casual about this,

221
00:11:32,412 --> 00:11:34,622
and their whole
high-schooler-living-alone-thing

222
00:11:34,705 --> 00:11:36,416
is way too forced!
[growls]

223
00:11:37,250 --> 00:11:40,711
Well, I had to establish
the playing field early on.

224
00:11:40,795 --> 00:11:41,629
[giggles]

225
00:11:41,712 --> 00:11:44,090
-[growls]
-[Riri screams]

226
00:11:47,135 --> 00:11:48,553
[Riri grunts]

227
00:11:48,636 --> 00:11:50,471
[groans, coughs]

228
00:11:51,681 --> 00:11:54,517
That's right. I've got
extra energy because I'm mad

229
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:56,477
-and you better watch out!
-[fingers cracking]

230
00:11:56,561 --> 00:11:57,812
-I expect nothing less.
-[growls]

231
00:11:57,895 --> 00:12:00,982
You're the anti-heroine type,
I recognized.

232
00:12:01,065 --> 00:12:02,775
NON-HEROINE

233
00:12:02,859 --> 00:12:03,734
[grunts]

234
00:12:03,818 --> 00:12:05,820
-I don't care what you call me…
-[groans]

235
00:12:05,903 --> 00:12:07,822
…just turn things back to normal now.

236
00:12:07,905 --> 00:12:10,324
-Give me back Momohiki!
-[wails]

237
00:12:10,408 --> 00:12:11,242
[Riri] Impossible!

238
00:12:11,826 --> 00:12:13,744
[breathing heavily]

239
00:12:13,828 --> 00:12:15,746
[panting]

240
00:12:16,497 --> 00:12:19,041
[echoes]
Damn it!

241
00:12:19,125 --> 00:12:20,334
Are you kidding me?

242
00:12:20,835 --> 00:12:22,753
-[Anzu] Chocolate!
-[seller 1] Oh, sorry.

243
00:12:22,837 --> 00:12:24,755
-[Anzu] Chocolate!
-[seller 2] We're closed today.

244
00:12:24,839 --> 00:12:25,673
[Anzu] Where's the chocolate!

245
00:12:25,756 --> 00:12:27,383
[seller 3] We're having
a sugar-free snack fair.

246
00:12:27,467 --> 00:12:29,385
ON SALE
MANAGER'S CHOICE

247
00:12:30,052 --> 00:12:30,970
For real?

248
00:12:32,597 --> 00:12:34,932
They're all sold out? Is that a thing?

249
00:12:35,016 --> 00:12:36,309
[whimpers]

250
00:12:36,392 --> 00:12:41,939
Am I cursed to never eat chocolate
ever again in my whole entire life? Ever?

251
00:12:42,899 --> 00:12:46,444
The chocolate… The cacao…
I'm getting withdrawals…

252
00:12:47,236 --> 00:12:49,697
Why is this happening?

253
00:12:49,780 --> 00:12:52,783
You're kidding me!

254
00:12:53,284 --> 00:12:55,995
[Anzu] Am I really gonna let
that thing who created

255
00:12:56,078 --> 00:12:58,748
that awful Romantic Thriller game
tell me what to do?

256
00:13:02,126 --> 00:13:04,337
No way! Not a chance!

257
00:13:04,420 --> 00:13:08,257
Even if a hot guy does show up,
I just won't fall in love, right?

258
00:13:08,341 --> 00:13:10,968
I'm sorry, but there's no way
someone exists in real life

259
00:13:11,052 --> 00:13:12,428
who could surpass the high standards

260
00:13:12,512 --> 00:13:14,889
I've set up after my experiences
with 2D guys.

261
00:13:16,474 --> 00:13:19,227
As long as
no romantic relationship develops,

262
00:13:19,310 --> 00:13:22,021
-then that thing will have no choice…
-[evil laughter]

263
00:13:22,104 --> 00:13:24,732
…but to give up and leave me alone!

264
00:13:24,815 --> 00:13:28,194
[sinister laughter]

265
00:13:28,277 --> 00:13:32,198
Sneaky devil who stole
my three greatest desires!

266
00:13:32,782 --> 00:13:36,202
Yes,  Romantic Thriller, you say?

267
00:13:36,285 --> 00:13:38,204
I will destroy it all.

268
00:13:38,287 --> 00:13:42,375
And I will become the Romantic Killer!

269
00:13:47,338 --> 00:13:51,217
That being said,
bring it on you so-called cuties!

270
00:13:54,303 --> 00:13:56,055
-Oh.
-[gasps]

271
00:13:58,140 --> 00:13:59,141
Aah!

272
00:13:59,225 --> 00:14:01,519
I am so sorry!
[whimpers]

273
00:14:01,602 --> 00:14:02,770
[sighs]

274
00:14:03,646 --> 00:14:05,022
That's a pretty good crack.

275
00:14:06,524 --> 00:14:08,985
[Anzu] Wow, a hot guy
actually showed up.

276
00:14:10,069 --> 00:14:13,197
I'm really sorry! I'll pay to fix it.

277
00:14:13,281 --> 00:14:15,575
[Tsukasa] You don't have
to pay for the repairs.

278
00:14:15,658 --> 00:14:16,576
What?

279
00:14:16,659 --> 00:14:19,453
I wasn't paying attention either.

280
00:14:20,663 --> 00:14:21,706
[exclaims]

281
00:14:22,665 --> 00:14:26,961
[Anzu] He's nothing compared to
Matthew and Musashimaru!

282
00:14:27,044 --> 00:14:28,462
-[girl wails]
-[boy grunts]

283
00:14:28,546 --> 00:14:31,549
Well, then, uh, thanks! Thanks a lot!

284
00:14:31,632 --> 00:14:34,927
I'm sorry I bumped you. Goodbye!

285
00:14:35,011 --> 00:14:36,137
[laughs awkwardly]

286
00:14:37,597 --> 00:14:39,223
Uh-- Uh…

287
00:14:45,730 --> 00:14:47,565
[Anzu] I'm off to school.

288
00:14:49,191 --> 00:14:50,026
[sighs]

289
00:14:50,860 --> 00:14:54,238
Not like there's anyone home to hear me.

290
00:14:54,864 --> 00:14:55,948
[sighs]

291
00:14:56,449 --> 00:15:00,119
I can't believe I ran into
that adorable guy yesterday.

292
00:15:01,412 --> 00:15:05,750
But as long as I avoid
getting involved, it's all good, right?

293
00:15:05,833 --> 00:15:07,376
[scoffs]
Just wait and see, devil!

294
00:15:07,460 --> 00:15:10,004
-Good morning to you!
-[Anzu] They're back!

295
00:15:10,087 --> 00:15:12,757
[Riri] All right.
Time to march on into school.

296
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:15,301
[grunts, laughs]

297
00:15:15,384 --> 00:15:16,385
Wait! What?

298
00:15:17,136 --> 00:15:19,055
[indistinct chatter]

299
00:15:23,643 --> 00:15:25,686
Why are you following me, huh?

300
00:15:25,770 --> 00:15:29,815
Not to worry, no one but you can see me.

301
00:15:29,899 --> 00:15:32,109
Exactly. That's what I'm worried about.

302
00:15:32,193 --> 00:15:35,321
I'll look crazy if people think
that I'm talking to myself.

303
00:15:35,404 --> 00:15:37,573
Don't worry about that, either.

304
00:15:37,657 --> 00:15:42,578
Whenever you're talking to me,
everyone else is seeing an illusion.

305
00:15:42,662 --> 00:15:43,913
So they won't notice.

306
00:15:43,996 --> 00:15:46,874
You're so annoying.
I'll probably just ignore you.

307
00:15:46,958 --> 00:15:48,918
[Riri] However, young lady…

308
00:15:49,001 --> 00:15:49,877
[Anzu grunts]

309
00:15:50,503 --> 00:15:51,879
[groans]

310
00:15:53,547 --> 00:15:57,468
[grunting]

311
00:15:58,511 --> 00:16:01,263
You must not underestimate my magic.

312
00:16:01,347 --> 00:16:03,975
But, come on!
That wasn't really magic at all!

313
00:16:04,058 --> 00:16:05,977
-I'm off before you take revenge.
-[Anzu gasps]

314
00:16:06,811 --> 00:16:07,853
[groans]

315
00:16:08,479 --> 00:16:10,272
-Huh?
-[exhales]

316
00:16:10,356 --> 00:16:13,192
[Anzu] It's that hottie from yesterday?

317
00:16:15,569 --> 00:16:17,655
That uniform… No way!

318
00:16:18,739 --> 00:16:21,158
[whimpers]
We go to the same school?

319
00:16:21,742 --> 00:16:22,702
That little devil!

320
00:16:22,785 --> 00:16:24,120
Are you okay, dear?

321
00:16:24,203 --> 00:16:28,207
I'm sorry. I'm such a total klutz.
[cheeky laughter]

322
00:16:28,290 --> 00:16:30,459
[Anzu] Riri set me up for that meeting.

323
00:16:30,543 --> 00:16:31,794
[evil laughter]

324
00:16:32,753 --> 00:16:34,755
Huh? You okay? What happened?

325
00:16:36,298 --> 00:16:38,884
Jeez, Tsukasa,
don't just stand there, give her a hand.

326
00:16:38,968 --> 00:16:39,802
[exclaims]

327
00:16:40,386 --> 00:16:42,430
Oh, that's okay. I'm totally fine!
[laughs awkwardly]

328
00:16:42,513 --> 00:16:44,807
[Anzu] I'm not gonna let that thing
have their way.

329
00:16:44,890 --> 00:16:46,809
[laughing continues]

330
00:16:47,435 --> 00:16:48,269
Uh…

331
00:16:51,897 --> 00:16:52,940
S-- See ya.

332
00:16:54,650 --> 00:16:57,153
Big deal, he ignored me too.

333
00:16:57,903 --> 00:16:58,738
[beeps]

334
00:17:01,991 --> 00:17:02,867
[beeps]

335
00:17:04,410 --> 00:17:06,912
-[gril 1] Oh, hey, here he comes. Look!
-[girl 2] Excuse me.

336
00:17:07,455 --> 00:17:09,081
You've been on my mind.

337
00:17:11,042 --> 00:17:13,252
Here you go.
Will you please read my letter?

338
00:17:14,253 --> 00:17:16,380
[Anzu] Oh, a girl's confessing
her love to him.

339
00:17:16,464 --> 00:17:17,757
Typical life of a hot guy.

340
00:17:19,300 --> 00:17:20,426
[girl 3] That was really brave of her.

341
00:17:20,509 --> 00:17:21,343
I don't want it.

342
00:17:21,427 --> 00:17:22,261
-[gasps]
-[whimpers]

343
00:17:23,012 --> 00:17:24,847
What? Uh, uh…

344
00:17:25,473 --> 00:17:26,390
Uh…

345
00:17:26,474 --> 00:17:28,934
I'm sorry about him.
[pants]

346
00:17:29,018 --> 00:17:29,977
Ouch.

347
00:17:30,061 --> 00:17:31,479
That poor girl.

348
00:17:31,562 --> 00:17:32,938
[Anzu] Hey, what was that?

349
00:17:33,022 --> 00:17:35,649
He's cute, but his personality?
Not so much.

350
00:17:35,733 --> 00:17:38,319
Hey, Tsukasa. Good morning.

351
00:17:38,402 --> 00:17:40,446
I saw that. But I do get it.

352
00:17:41,113 --> 00:17:45,534
A letter is just a little bit extra
these days, don't you think so?

353
00:17:45,618 --> 00:17:48,037
Really? I'd be flattered
if I got a letter.

354
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:50,831
I mean, you should've
at least accepted it from her.

355
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:55,002
I don't want her to get
the wrong idea from me.

356
00:17:55,586 --> 00:17:56,921
-[Rena] I understand.
-[groans in disgust]

357
00:17:57,004 --> 00:17:58,547
[Rena] She's not your type, right?

358
00:17:58,631 --> 00:18:02,259
[Anzu] Ugh! He's full of himself
just because he's a little popular.

359
00:18:02,343 --> 00:18:04,804
There's no way I'd date a guy like him!

360
00:18:04,887 --> 00:18:08,599
[Rena] But anyway, I sent you a message
yesterday and you didn't even read it.

361
00:18:08,682 --> 00:18:09,975
-[Tsukasa] My phone broke.
-[Rena gasps]

362
00:18:10,059 --> 00:18:10,893
[gasps]

363
00:18:14,772 --> 00:18:16,774
-[Rena] That blows.
-[Makoto] Do you have insurance?

364
00:18:16,857 --> 00:18:18,484
[Tsukasa] I was cheap, I didn't get it.

365
00:18:18,567 --> 00:18:19,944
-[Rena] Seriously? That sucks!
-[wails]

366
00:18:20,027 --> 00:18:22,446
[Rena] I'd die without my phone.

367
00:18:22,530 --> 00:18:24,782
-Aren you gonna buy a new one?
-[wailing continues]

368
00:18:24,865 --> 00:18:27,243
[Tsukasa]
Not for a while. I can't afford it.

369
00:18:27,326 --> 00:18:28,744
-[Rena] Really?
-[Anzu groans]

370
00:18:29,286 --> 00:18:31,163
[school bell rings]

371
00:18:32,331 --> 00:18:33,207
[Saki] Whoa.

372
00:18:33,290 --> 00:18:36,210
Your dad was transferred
to the US out of nowhere?

373
00:18:36,794 --> 00:18:37,711
[Anzu] Yeah,

374
00:18:37,795 --> 00:18:40,714
that's the reason why I didn't have
any time to make my lunch today.

375
00:18:41,298 --> 00:18:43,592
Sorry to drag you here with me, Saki.

376
00:18:43,676 --> 00:18:46,512
No worries.
It's my first time here. I'm excited.

377
00:18:46,595 --> 00:18:49,849
[Anzu] Right? Now let's see,
what should I eat?

378
00:18:50,474 --> 00:18:52,059
[Makoto] I'll order for both of us.

379
00:18:52,601 --> 00:18:54,353
[Anzu] All right, the decision is made.

380
00:18:54,436 --> 00:18:55,771
[Tsukasa] Uh, I'll get…

381
00:18:56,355 --> 00:18:57,481
[both] Lunch set A.

382
00:18:57,565 --> 00:18:58,524
[both gasp]

383
00:18:59,191 --> 00:19:00,860
[distressed groans]

384
00:19:05,447 --> 00:19:08,325
[Saki] I think he's the hot guy
that everyone's been talking about.

385
00:19:08,409 --> 00:19:10,286
-Kazuki from Class 7.
-[girls yell excitedly]

386
00:19:10,953 --> 00:19:12,037
[Anzu] Kazuki?

387
00:19:13,205 --> 00:19:14,290
I see.

388
00:19:14,373 --> 00:19:17,209
Yeah. And he's really popular
with all the girls.

389
00:19:17,293 --> 00:19:19,211
[giggles]
You probably didn't notice

390
00:19:19,295 --> 00:19:21,922
because you're usually busy
playing your video games during lunch

391
00:19:22,006 --> 00:19:24,258
[grunts, laughs awkwardly]

392
00:19:25,926 --> 00:19:28,637
I heard he moved here alone
from another prefecture.

393
00:19:29,138 --> 00:19:31,432
Apparently, the girls like him
because he's reserved

394
00:19:31,515 --> 00:19:34,059
-and doesn't smile much.
-I see.

395
00:19:34,143 --> 00:19:35,227
I don't want it.

396
00:19:35,978 --> 00:19:38,522
I don't want her
to get the wrong idea from me.

397
00:19:39,190 --> 00:19:41,025
[Anzu] He's reserved, huh?

398
00:19:41,108 --> 00:19:43,944
I'd say he's got some personality issues

399
00:19:44,028 --> 00:19:48,866
Slowly falling in love after a terrible
first impression is a classic scenario.

400
00:19:48,949 --> 00:19:49,783
Shut up!

401
00:19:52,328 --> 00:19:54,496
-Time to eat.
-[Rena] Tsukasa!

402
00:19:54,580 --> 00:19:56,832
-I'm gonna sit next to you.
-[chokes]

403
00:19:57,708 --> 00:20:00,961
Oh. So, hey, I heard
you live all by yourself.

404
00:20:01,045 --> 00:20:05,591
That's nuts. I wanna come and hang out.
Where do you live?

405
00:20:05,674 --> 00:20:08,469
[Anzu] Ugh! I'm not listening!
Not listening! No!

406
00:20:08,552 --> 00:20:09,470
[indistinct chatter]

407
00:20:09,553 --> 00:20:12,723
I gotta shut out
all the information I don't want to know!

408
00:20:12,806 --> 00:20:15,935
I gotta avoid going to the cafeteria
as much as possible.

409
00:20:16,018 --> 00:20:16,977
[groans]

410
00:20:20,731 --> 00:20:22,733
There's nothing to do here!

411
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:24,276
I'm bored.

412
00:20:25,694 --> 00:20:27,321
[wails]

413
00:20:27,404 --> 00:20:30,658
How do people live without gaming?

414
00:20:31,575 --> 00:20:35,079
Momohiki is gone and there's no chocolate.

415
00:20:35,663 --> 00:20:36,497
[sighs]

416
00:20:36,580 --> 00:20:37,456
[grunts]

417
00:20:38,624 --> 00:20:40,501
[stomach rumbles]

418
00:20:40,584 --> 00:20:41,669
[TV beeps]

419
00:20:41,752 --> 00:20:44,004
Time to make dinner.
[groans]

420
00:20:49,093 --> 00:20:50,052
[sighs]

421
00:20:50,135 --> 00:20:50,970
[gasps]

422
00:20:52,513 --> 00:20:55,474
[Anzu shrieks]

423
00:20:55,557 --> 00:20:59,103
[narrator] Roaches are unseemly,
so instead, cake. You're welcome!

424
00:20:59,186 --> 00:21:01,939
[terrified moans, screams]

425
00:21:02,022 --> 00:21:02,856
THE GLASS IS IMAGINARY

426
00:21:02,940 --> 00:21:05,442
[screams]
Mommy!

427
00:21:08,195 --> 00:21:10,322
[wails]

428
00:21:10,406 --> 00:21:14,034
Oh, that's right!
I lost my extermination expert!

429
00:21:14,118 --> 00:21:16,078
-She would get rid of them for me.
-[giggles]

430
00:21:19,707 --> 00:21:20,582
[grunts]

431
00:21:21,166 --> 00:21:25,087
[Anzu] It's time to awaken
the soldier within me!

432
00:21:25,796 --> 00:21:27,548
[roars]

433
00:21:27,631 --> 00:21:29,091
Go!

434
00:21:29,883 --> 00:21:30,759
[toots]

435
00:21:32,386 --> 00:21:34,430
Damn, it's empty!

436
00:21:37,766 --> 00:21:41,312
[groans, screams]

437
00:21:43,856 --> 00:21:46,191
[shrieks]

438
00:21:52,823 --> 00:21:55,784
[Anzu] I rushed out,
I didn't bring anything with me.

439
00:21:55,868 --> 00:21:58,245
And I'm wearing two different shoes.

440
00:21:58,329 --> 00:22:01,582
I don't want to go home,
but I'm seriously starving.

441
00:22:02,374 --> 00:22:04,376
[sobs]
Mommy.

442
00:22:05,044 --> 00:22:06,003
[sniffs]

443
00:22:09,631 --> 00:22:11,675
Ugh! This is the worst!

444
00:22:11,759 --> 00:22:13,635
I need to take cover somewhere.

445
00:22:15,220 --> 00:22:16,055
[grunts]

446
00:22:17,806 --> 00:22:18,640
[grunts continues]

447
00:22:28,150 --> 00:22:30,235
And it's pouring.

448
00:22:42,706 --> 00:22:43,540
[Anzu] Huh?

449
00:22:48,879 --> 00:22:49,880
Uh…

450
00:22:52,966 --> 00:22:54,510
A fanfare, please!

451
00:22:54,593 --> 00:22:56,678
And a big congratulations!

452
00:22:56,762 --> 00:22:58,680
Did you fall for my little trick?

453
00:22:58,764 --> 00:23:02,184
I bet now you don't feel like
skipping the ending, right?

454
00:23:02,267 --> 00:23:05,854
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

455
00:23:05,938 --> 00:23:08,607
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

456
00:23:08,690 --> 00:23:10,984
[sighs]
Don't just let things be! Come on!

457
00:23:11,068 --> 00:23:13,654
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

458
00:23:13,737 --> 00:23:15,656
So I can make sure I get paid.

459
00:23:15,739 --> 00:23:17,908
[closing theme music]

460
00:23:17,991 --> 00:23:18,826
♪ Ah, yeah! ♪

461
00:23:21,453 --> 00:23:22,287
♪ Let's go! ♪

462
00:23:24,706 --> 00:23:25,958
♪ Lo-love! ♪

463
00:23:28,043 --> 00:23:28,877
♪ Here we go! ♪

464
00:00:01,817 --> 00:00:05,404
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

465
00:00:05,488 --> 00:00:08,157
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

466
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:10,534
[sighs]
Don't just let things be! Come on!

467
00:00:10,618 --> 00:00:13,204
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

468
00:00:13,287 --> 00:00:15,206
So I can make sure I get paid.

469
